{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Charlotte part en safari", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Comment le serpent a perdu ses pattes", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Legend Has It... > Africa", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant identifie et d\u00e9crit des plans concernant l'organisation d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "frn5le06ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Les expressions pour parler d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements pass\u00e9s", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Voici des expressions que l'on peut utiliser pour parler des \u00e9v\u00e9nements qui se sont d\u00e9roul\u00e9s dans le pass\u00e9. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">il y a longtemps <br/>\u00e0 cette \u00e9poque-l\u00e0 <br/>un jour <br/>la semaine derni\u00e8re <br/>le mois/l'an dernier<br/>cette nuit-l\u00e0<br/>la semaine derni\u00e8re <br/>hier, hier soir <br/>avant hier <br/>la veille (= le soir avant ce jour) <br/>la journ\u00e9e pr\u00e9c\u00e9dente", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Il y a longtemps en Afrique, la Lune a expliqu\u00e9 aux animaux qu'il n'y aurait pas de pluie durant toute l'ann\u00e9e. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "\u00c0 cette \u00e9poque, le serpent avait les pattes comme les autres animaux. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "L'imparfait", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "On utilise souvent l'imparfait pour raconter des histoires comme des mythes ou des l\u00e9gendes. <br/>Il est utile de d\u00e9crire la situation initiale avant le d\u00e9veloppement du probl\u00e8me.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "\u00c0 cette \u00e9poque, le serpent avait les pattes comme les autres animaux. Il \u00e9tait orgueilleux, et il voulait rester.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Le serpent ne pouvait plus marcher. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sujet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verbe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le serpent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"avait\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"il\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\u00e9tait\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"il\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"voulait\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"il\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ne pouvait plus\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "s'effrayer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "avoir peur", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Tous les animaux se sont effray\u00e9s et se sont enfuis, except\u00e9 le serpent.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous utilisez pour raconter un mythe. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "orgueilleux, orgueilleuse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "arrogant ; pr\u00e9tentieux", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il \u00e9tait orgueilleux, et il voulait rester.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "prendre en piti\u00e9", "type": "name"}, {"content": "des sentiments de compassion pour quelqu'un", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La Lune l'a regard\u00e9 et l'a pris en piti\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la patte", "type": "name"}, {"content": "membre inf\u00e9rieur des animaux permettant la marche", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : \u00c0 cette \u00e9poque, le serpent avait les pattes comme les autres animaux.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "s'enfuir", "type": "name"}, {"content": "vouloir \u00e9chapper \u00e0 quelque chose ; se sauver", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le serpent s'est enfui \u00e0 mon arriv\u00e9e. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le serpent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "reptile sans pattes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Elle lui a retir\u00e9 ses pattes, et le serpent est parti dans le d\u00e9sert en rampant dans le sable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "se fatiguer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "perdre l'\u00e9nergie ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Bient\u00f4t, il s'est fatigu\u00e9. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "supplier", "type": "name"}, {"content": "demander avec humilit\u00e9 et soumission", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il a suppli\u00e9 la Lune de l'aider.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ramper", "type": "name"}, {"content": "progresser sur le ventre", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La vigne rampe sur les fen\u00eatres du b\u00e2timent.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le